{
  "$comment": "THE PIPELINE FILE `.exponential/ci.json` (#EXP-1613, #EXP-1617; src/pipeline.ts, ecode-core pipeline.rs). SHAPE: {version: 1, name?, on: {push?: {branches?}, pull_request?: {branches? (the BASE branch)}, tag?: {tags?}, merge_train?: {}, manual?: {}}, env?: {NAME: value}, secrets?: [NAME], jobs: {<key>: {name?, runsOn: [label], needs?: [key], timeoutMin?, env?, secrets?, paths?: [glob], matrix?: {<key>: [value]}, steps: [{name, run, env?, timeoutMin?, continueOnError?, workingDirectory?}]}}, required?: [check name]}. Names: a job key `^[a-z][a-z0-9_-]{0,63}$`, env and secret names `^[A-Z_][A-Z0-9_]*$`, matrix keys `^[a-z][a-z0-9_]*$`, labels per contract runner (lowercase). `validate` returns EVERY error as {path (JSON pointer), code}, sorted by path then code; codes: unknown_field, missing, type, invalid_value, invalid_name, invalid_label, invalid_glob, unknown_need, unknown_required, cycle (one, at /jobs, only when every need names a job), limit (contract pipeline: expanded jobs at /jobs, steps, matrix combinations). `glob`: `**` = any run of path segments (`**/` may match none), `*` = any run of characters but `/`, `?` = one character but `/`. `plan` (a VALID file + a trigger → null when the trigger does not fire): jobs ordered by `needs` (the first ready job in file order each time), each expanded over its matrix (first key outermost) into one CHECK named `name (v1, v2)`; `needs` = the check names of every expansion of each needed job; `env` = top env < job env < MATRIX_<KEY> (sorted); steps carry their merged env; `secrets` = top ∪ job, sorted; `skip`: `fork` for a pull_request from outside the team (never runs), else `paths` when changed files are known and none matches the job's `paths`. GitHub workflow YAML is read into this same shape (#EXP-1617).",
  "glob": [
    {
      "pattern": "apps/web/**",
      "path": "apps/web/src/a.ts",
      "match": true
    },
    {
      "pattern": "apps/web/**",
      "path": "apps/webx/a.ts",
      "match": false
    },
    {
      "pattern": "**/*.md",
      "path": "README.md",
      "match": true
    },
    {
      "pattern": "**/*.md",
      "path": "docs/spec/a.md",
      "match": true
    },
    {
      "pattern": "*.md",
      "path": "docs/a.md",
      "match": false
    },
    {
      "pattern": "packages/*/src/*.ts",
      "path": "packages/ecode/src/forge.ts",
      "match": true
    },
    {
      "pattern": "packages/*/src/*.ts",
      "path": "packages/ecode/src/sub/forge.ts",
      "match": false
    },
    {
      "pattern": "v?.*",
      "path": "v1.2",
      "match": true
    },
    {
      "pattern": "v?.*",
      "path": "v10.2",
      "match": false
    },
    {
      "pattern": "main",
      "path": "main",
      "match": true
    },
    {
      "pattern": "release/**",
      "path": "release/2026/11",
      "match": true
    },
    {
      "pattern": "**",
      "path": "anything/at/all",
      "match": true
    }
  ],
